<section class="hero" id="hero"><div class="hero-bg"></div><div class="particles" id="particles"></div><div class="hero-content">
<div class="hero-badge"><span class="dot"></span>EU-Funded | UNDP Technical Partner | 2025-2030</div>
<h1 class="typing-headline"><span class="typing-line" id="typingLine1"></span><br><span class="typing-line gt" id="typingLine2"></span><span class="typing-cursor">|</span></h1>
<p>A ai is a next-generation, privacy-preserving legal aid platform bringing autonomous AI dispute resolution, voice-first Bengali intake, and zero-knowledge cryptography to 682,500+ vulnerable citizens across all 64 districts of Bangladesh.</p>
<div class="hero-buttons"><a href="#solution" class="btn-p"><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Explore Platform</a><a href="#features" class="btn-s"><i class="fas fa-play-circle"></i> How It Works</a></div>
<div class="hero-stats"><div class="hero-stat"><div class="num">682,500+</div><div class="label">Target Beneficiaries</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="num">300</div><div class="label">Pilot Unions</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="num">$3.24M</div><div class="label">EU Funding</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="num">64</div><div class="label">Districts Nationwide</div></div></div>
</div></section>

<section id="problem"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">The Crisis</div><h2>7.5 Million Cases. Millions Left Behind.</h2><p>Bangladesh's judicial system faces unprecedented strain across all 64 districts, with vulnerable populations bearing the heaviest burden.</p></div><div class="pgrid">
<div class="pcard reveal"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444"><i class="fas fa-gavel"></i></div><h3>Judicial Backlog</h3><p>Over 7.5M cases clog the judicial pipeline.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444">7.5M+ pending</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd1"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b"><i class="fas fa-user-slash"></i></div><h3>Literacy Barriers</h3><p>Complex forms exclude millions of illiterate citizens.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b">Low digital access</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd2"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,.15);color:#ec4899"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div><h3>GBV Vulnerability</h3><p>Victims fear public exposure, lacking safe channels.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,.15);color:#ec4899">Critical safety gap</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd3"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(99,102,241,.15);color:#6366f1"><i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i></div><h3>Paper Bureaucracy</h3><p>Fragmented manual systems create massive inefficiencies.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(99,102,241,.15);color:#6366f1">Months of delays</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd4"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(14,165,233,.15);color:#0ea5e9"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i></div><h3>Geographic Isolation</h3><p>Multi-day connectivity blackouts during monsoons.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(14,165,233,.15);color:#0ea5e9">Connectivity collapses</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd5"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.15);color:#a855f7"><i class="fas fa-coins"></i></div><h3>Payment Delays</h3><p>Panel lawyers wait months for invoicing.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.15);color:#a855f7">Months of waiting</span></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="solution" style="background:rgba(2,6,23,.5)"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">The Solution</div><h2>A ai: Next-Gen Legal Aid</h2><p>An AI-augmented, privacy-preserving platform serving vulnerable citizens across all 64 districts.</p></div><div class="sol-show"><div class="sol-vis reveal">
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i><span>Multimodal Ingestion | Voice, USSD, Vision AI</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i><span>Cognitive AI | Legal-SLM &amp; RAG Engine</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i><span>Zero-Knowledge Privacy Vault (zk-SNARKs)</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-video"></i><span>Virtual ODR | WebRTC Mediation</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Automated Settlement &amp; Merkle Audit</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-mobile"></i><span>MFS Honorarium | bKash Auto-Payout</span></div>
</div><div class="sol-feat reveal rd2">
<div class="sfeat"><div class="sficon" style="background:rgba(14,165,233,.15);color:#0ea5e9"><i class="fas fa-microphone"></i></div><div><h4>Voice-First Bengali AI</h4><p>Dialect-adaptive agents for Chittagonian, Sylheti, Rangpuri.</p></div></div>
<div class="sfeat"><div class="sficon" style="background:rgba(99,102,241,.15);color:#6366f1"><i class="fas fa-eye"></i></div><div><h4>Vision AI Parser</h4><p>Transformer OCR on handwritten Bengali land deeds, 94%+ accuracy.</p></div></div>
<div class="sfeat"><div class="sficon" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,.15);color:#ec4899"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i></div><div><h4>Zero-Knowledge Privacy</h4><p>zk-SNARK proofs protect GBV survivors without exposing details.</p></div></div>
<div class="sfeat"><div class="sficon" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b"><i class="fas fa-wifi"></i></div><div><h4>14-Day Offline</h4><p>CRDT-powered edge kiosks operate fully offline.</p></div></div>
</div></div></div></section>

<section id="features"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">Core Capabilities</div><h2>Four Pillars of Autonomous Justice</h2><p>Engineered for sovereignty, privacy, and scale.</p></div><div class="fgrid">
<div class="fcard reveal"><div class="fiwrap" style="background:rgba(14,165,233,.15);color:#0ea5e9"><i class="fas fa-comment-dots"></i></div><h3>Autonomous Intake</h3><p>Voice AI, Vision AI, offline kiosks, and WhatsApp assistant deployed across all 64 districts.</p><div class="ftags"><span class="ftag">Whisper ASR</span><span class="ftag">FastSpeech2</span><span class="ftag">USSD</span></div></div>
<div class="fcard reveal rd1"><div class="fiwrap" style="background:rgba(99,102,241,.15);color:#6366f1"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i></div><h3>Cognitive Intelligence</h3><p>Legal merit classification and conflict-of-interest checks for cases in any district.</p><div class="ftags"><span class="ftag">Legal-SLM</span><span class="ftag">Neo4j</span><span class="ftag">RAG</span></div></div>
<div class="fcard reveal rd2"><div class="fiwrap" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.15);color:#10b981"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div><h3>Virtual ODR</h3><p>Low-bandwidth WebRTC mediation with AI sentiment co-pilot, accessible from any district.</p><div class="ftags"><span class="ftag">WebRTC</span><span class="ftag">LiveKit</span><span class="ftag">Sentiment</span></div></div>
<div class="fcard reveal rd3"><div class="fiwrap" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div><h3>Sovereign Trust</h3><p>ZK proofs, post-quantum crypto, Merkle audit trails.</p><div class="ftags"><span class="ftag">zk-SNARKs</span><span class="ftag">ML-KEM</span><span class="ftag">Merkle</span></div></div>
<div class="fcard reveal rd4"><div class="fiwrap" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,.15);color:#ec4899"><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt"></i></div><h3>Spatial Analytics</h3><p>Geospatial heatmaps and legal desert detection across all 64 districts.</p><div class="ftags"><span class="ftag">GIS</span><span class="ftag">Night-Light</span><span class="ftag">Predictive</span></div></div>
<div class="fcard reveal rd5"><div class="fiwrap" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.15);color:#a855f7"><i class="fas fa-wallet"></i></div><h3>Auto Honorarium</h3><p>Micro-disbursements to bKash/Nagad wallets.</p><div class="ftags"><span class="ftag">bKash</span><span class="ftag">Nagad</span><span class="ftag">Escrow</span></div></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="personas" style="background:rgba(2,6,23,.5)"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">Human Stories</div><h2>Designed for Real People</h2><p>Built around the lived experiences of vulnerable citizens across all 64 districts.</p></div><div class="persgrid">
<div class="percard reveal"><div class="pavatar" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,.1);color:#ec4899">👩</div><h3>Rokeya Begum</h3><div class="prole">Rural Woman | Illiterate</div><p>38, Kurigram. Dials 16430 and voice AI handles everything.</p><div class="pchannel"><i class="fas fas fa-phone-alt"></i> Voice IVR</div></div>
<div class="percard reveal rd1"><div class="pavatar" style="background:rgba(14,165,233,.1);color:#0ea5e9">🧑</div><h3>Santona Murmu</h3><div class="prole">Indigenous Youth</div><p>21, Dinajpur. Scans 1965 deed with Vision AI.</p><div class="pchannel"><i class="fas fas fa-mobile-alt"></i> PWA</div></div>
<div class="percard reveal rd2"><div class="pavatar" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.1);color:#f59e0b">🛡</div><h3>Shampa Akhter</h3><div class="prole">GBV Survivor</div><p>27, Gazipur. Calculator app for ZK emergency shelter.</p><div class="pchannel"><i class="fas fas fa-calculator"></i> Stealth App</div></div>
<div class="percard reveal rd3"><div class="pavatar" style="background:rgba(99,102,241,.1);color:#6366f1">⚖</div><h3>Adv. Anisur Rahman</h3><div class="prole">Panel Lawyer</div><p>44, District Bar. AI briefs and auto-payment.</p><div class="pchannel"><i class="fas fas fa-laptop"></i> Lawyer Copilot</div></div>
<div class="percard reveal rd4"><div class="pavatar" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.1);color:#10b981">🤝</div><h3>Sharmin Sultana</h3><div class="prole">Special Mediator</div><p>52, Union Parishad. Low-bandwidth ODR with AI.</p><div class="pchannel"><i class="fas fas fa-video"></i> WebRTC ODR</div></div>
<div class="percard reveal rd5"><div class="pavatar" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.1);color:#a855f7">📊</div><h3>DBLA Director</h3><div class="prole">Justice Leadership</div><p>Real-time heatmap and EU donor reports.</p><div class="pchannel"><i class="fas fas fa-satellite-dish"></i> Analytics</div></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="sstats" id="impact"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">Target Impact</div><h2>Transformation at Scale</h2><p>Measurable outcomes across all 64 districts by 2030.</p></div><div class="sg">
<div class="si reveal"><div class="sn" data-target="40" data-suffix="%" data-decimals="0">0%</div><div class="sl">Dispute Diversion to AI-ODR</div></div>
<div class="si reveal rd1"><div class="sn" data-target="50000" data-suffix="+" data-decimals="0">0+</div><div class="sl">Concurrent Peak Sessions</div></div>
<div class="si reveal rd2"><div class="sn" data-target="99.95" data-suffix="%" data-decimals="2">0%</div><div class="sl">System Uptime</div></div>
<div class="si reveal rd3"><div class="sn">&lt;150ms</div><div class="sl">API P99 Response</div></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="flow"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">User Journey</div><h2>Voice-First Intake Flow</h2><p>How citizens like Rokeya access justice through a simple phone call in any district.</p></div><div class="fsteps">
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#0284c7)">1</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Dials Toll-Free 16430</h3><p>Missed call triggers auto-callback in her local dialect.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-phone"></i> PSTN Voice Gateway</div></div></div>
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5)">2</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Conversational AI Intake</h3><p>Voice Agent gathers facts via natural speech.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-brain"></i> Whisper ASR</div></div></div>
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#059669)">3</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Automated Triage</h3><p>AI runs means-test and routes to Village Court.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-check-double"></i> Auto-Triage</div></div></div>
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706)">4</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Case Minted</h3><p>Cryptographically minted case with officer alert.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-certificate"></i> Merkle Trail</div></div></div>
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ec4899,#db2777)">5</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Confirmation</h3><p>Voice confirmation and SMS sent.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-sms"></i> Voice + SMS</div></div></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="roadmap" style="background:rgba(2,6,23,.5)"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">Strategic Roadmap</div><h2>2025-2030 Transformation</h2><p>Phased rollout from pilot unions to all 64 districts nationwide.</p></div><div class="tl">
<div class="tlitem reveal"><div class="tlcontent"><div class="tlyear">Phase 1 | May-Dec 2025</div><h3>Foundation &amp; Cognitive Pilot</h3><p>Architecture, sovereign cloud, CMS MVP.</p></div><div class="tldot"></div></div>
<div class="tlitem reveal rd1"><div class="tlcontent"><div class="tlyear">Phase 1.5 | Nov 2025-Apr 2026</div><h3>50-Union Pilot</h3><p>Deployment across 50 high-vulnerability unions.</p></div><div class="tldot"></div></div>
<div class="tlitem reveal rd2"><div class="tlcontent"><div class="tlyear">Phase 2 | May-Nov 2026</div><h3>Scale to 300 Unions</h3><p>ODR chambers, sentiment co-pilot, 1,000+ actors.</p></div><div class="tldot"></div></div>
<div class="tlitem reveal rd3"><div class="tlcontent"><div class="tlyear">Phase 3 | May-Nov 2027</div><h3>National Grid Sync</h3><p>Supreme Court MIS, post-quantum cryptography.</p></div><div class="tldot"></div></div>
<div class="tlitem reveal rd4"><div class="tlcontent"><div class="tlyear">Phase 3.5 | Jan-Apr 2028</div><h3>Autonomous Handover</h3><p>Full DBLA handover across all 64 districts.</p></div><div class="tldot"></div></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="partners"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">Strategic Partners</div><h2>Backed by Global Institutions</h2></div><div class="pg">
<div class="part reveal"><div class="plogo">🇪🇺</div><div class="pname">European Union</div><div style="color:#475569;font-size:.75rem">Funding Partner</div></div>
